OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATower developer 'not doing        
OL,4,Aenough', says Rayner                   
OL,6,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner has    
OL,7,Fsaid a developer is not doing enough to
OL,8,Fsupport people forced from their homes 
OL,9,Fin east London over structural safety  
OL,10,Ffears.                                 
OL,12,FResidents and businesses at the Royal  
OL,13,FGateway development in Canning Town,   
OL,14,Falso known as Caxton Works, had to     
OL,15,Fleave suddenly when defects were found 
OL,16,Fin the buildings last month.           
OL,18,FThey are still waiting to find out when
OL,19,Fthey can return.                       
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
