OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATower developer 'not doing        
OL,4,Aenough', says Rayner                   
OL,6,FGalliard Homes, which built the scheme 
OL,7,Fless than 10 years ago, offered to     
OL,8,Fcover relocation costs and arrange     
OL,9,Ftemporary accommodation, but Rayner    
OL,10,Ftold BBC London the situation was      
OL,11,F"completely unacceptable" and          
OL,12,Fcriticised how the firm had            
OL,13,Fcommunicated with residents.           
